s/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#2-po-input-bottom-padding-misaligns-buttons-8px-offset","content":"**Fix:** Add `margin-bottom: 8px` to the button element or its container."},"3554":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-35","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#4-po-input-p-maxlength-binding-name","content":"**Symptom:** Angular compilation error: `NG8002: Can't bind to 'p-max-length' since it isn't a known property of 'po-input'`."},"3555":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-36","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#4-po-input-p-maxlength-binding-name","content":"**Root cause:** The correct Angular input alias is `p-maxlength` (no hyphen between `max` and `length`)."},"3556":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-37","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"**Symptom:** Binding `(p-value-change)=\"myHandler($event)\"` on `po-dynamic-form` compiles\nwithout errors but the handler is never called, regardless of what the user types."},"3557":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-38","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"**Root cause:** `PoDynamicFormBaseComponent` declares only one `@Output`: `outputs: \\{ formOutput: \"p-form\" \\}`.\nThere is no `p-value-change` output. Angular silently ignores unknown event bindings — no error, no warning."},"3558":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-39","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"**Fix: use `(p-form)` para receber o `NgForm`, depois subscribir em `form.valueChanges`.**"},"3559":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-40","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"**Notas:**"},"3560":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-41","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"`form.valueChanges` dispara a cada tecla em `po-decimal`/`po-number` e no blur em campos texto"},"3561":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-42","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"`[(p-value)]` two-way binding também falha silenciosamente — usar `[p-value]` (one-way) para inicialização e atualizar `headerValues` no subscribe"},"3562":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-43","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"Para `modal-crud`: usar `@ViewChild(PoDynamicFormComponent) dynamicForm` e ler `this.dynamicForm.value` diretamente no save"},"3563":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-44","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#15-po-stepper-api-incorreta--back-não-reseta-estado-done-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"**Symptom 1 — NG8002 em `[p-current-active-step]`:**"},"3564":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-45","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#15-po-stepper-api-incorreta--back-não-reseta-estado-done-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"**Symptom 2 — Após clicar \"Anterior\", step visitado permanece marcado como concluído (círculo cheio).**"},"3565":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-46","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#15-po-stepper-api-incorreta--back-não-reseta-estado-done-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"**Root cause:**"},"3566":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-47","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#15-po-stepper-api-incorreta--back-não-reseta-estado-done-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"`[p-current-active-step]` e `(p-current-active-step)` **não existem** em `po-stepper`"},"3567":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-48","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#15-po-stepper-api-incorreta--back-não-reseta-estado-done-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"O input real é `[p-step]` e o output real é `(p-change-step)`"},"3568":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-49","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#15-po-stepper-api-incorreta--back-não-reseta-estado-done-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"Mesmo usando `[p-step]`, o `po-stepper` avança marcando steps como 'done' mas **não reseta** ao voltar"},"3569":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-50","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#15-po-stepper-api-incorreta--back-não-reseta-estado-done-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"**Fix:**"},"3570":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-51","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#15-po-stepper-api-incorreta--back-não-reseta-estado-done-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"**Note:** `PoStepperStatus` não está exportado no public\\_api. Usar `PoStep