` in `ngOnInit` is NOT enough:** `markForCheck()` schedules a check\nfor the *next* CD cycle triggered by Angular's zone. In a route-activated component where\nno zone event fires after init (no HTTP call, no timer, no user interaction), that cycle\nnever arrives. The fields are in the DOM but visually blank until a click event."],[3640,"**Why not `markForCheck()`:** `markForCheck()` schedules a future CD pass; if Angular's zone\nnever fires again (no HTTP, no timer after the expand click), the check never runs.\n`detectChanges()` is synchronous and runs immediately."],[3637,"**Why the zone event works:** Clicking anywhere else on the host (breadcrumb, filter, other\nrows) triggers Angular's zone, which schedules a global CD pass that picks up the already-\ntoggled detail flag. This is why the content \"appears on the next click.\""],[799,"/connect"],[818,"/discover"],[820,"/discover"],[859,"/docs"],[885,"/e2e"],[913,"/generate"],[397,"/generate — gerar um componente PO-UI"],[942,"/lint"],[1032,"/migrate"],[1077,"/package"],[801,"/poui-specialist:connect"],[861,"/poui-specialist:docs"],[887,"/poui-specialist:e2e"],[915,"/poui-specialist:generate"],[944,"/poui-specialist:lint"],[1034,"/poui-specialist:migrate"],[1079,"/poui-specialist:package"],[1099,"/poui-specialist:review"],[1265,"/poui-specialist:test"],[1306,"/poui-specialist:undo"],[1097,"/review"],[1232,"/scaffold"],[1234,"/scaffold"],[1263,"/test"],[398,"/test — gerar spec Karma + Jasmine para um componente"],[1304,"/undo"],[54,"\\[1.0.0] — 2026-05-28"],[52,"\\[1.1.0] — 2026-06-03"],[24,"\\[1.10.0] — 2026-07-01"],[21,"\\[1.11.0] — 2026-07-13"],[18,"\\[1.12.0] — 2026-07-13"],[16,"\\[1.12.1] — 2026-07-13"],[12,"\\[1.13.0] — 2026-07-23"],[10,"\\[1.13.1] — 2026-07-30"],[8,"\\[1.14.0] — 2026-07-30"],[6,"\\[1.15.0] — 2026-07-30"],[4,"\\[1.15.1] — 2026-07-30"],[50,"\\[1.2.0] — 2026-06-09"],[47,"\\[1.3.0] — 2026-06-11"],[44,"\\[1.4.0] — 2026-06-23"],[41,"\\[1.5.0] — 2026-06-24"],[38,"\\[1.5.1] — 2026-06-25"],[34,"\\[